425
00:37:55.910 --> 00:37:59.980
Why are you mocking Eugyeom?
who does nothing but study?

426
00:38:01.180 --> 00:38:02.510
Look at him.

427
00:38:03.350 --> 00:38:05.900
- On the way out. Hey Kang Yoongi.
- Yes.

428
00:38:05.980 --> 00:38:08.170
Take Eugyeom to the infirmary.

429
00:38:08.250 --> 00:38:09.120
Yes.

430
