443
00:38:49.460 --> 00:38:50.860
Look at him.

444
00:38:53.900 --> 00:38:55.530
Former athlete...

445
00:38:56.830 --> 00:38:57.970
manners

446
00:38:58.800 --> 00:38:59.970
must be

447
00:39:00.570 --> 00:39:01.880
